{"ID":"20240314091827-pnj23to","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091827-pnj23to","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091827-pnj23to\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170919-lvkmd1q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170928-497pm45\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170928-497pm45\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【当归芍药散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170928"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170919-lvkmd1q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170919-lvkmd1q","updated":"20240422170919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人怀孕，腹中绞痛，当归芍药散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170919-b4wlzzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170919-b4wlzzy","updated":"20240422170919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当归芍药散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170919-ze2t5oi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170919-ze2t5oi","updated":"20240422170919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归川芎各三两芍药一斤茯苓白朮各四两泽泻半斤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170919-3nsqnqw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170919-3nsqnqw","updated":"20240422170919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右六味，杵为散，取方寸匕，酒和日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170919-zittil5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170919-zittil5","updated":"20240422170919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紧接胶艾汤的就是我们很有名的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归芍药散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。大家一定要了解当归芍药散的主要的症状，功能是干什么。你如果看到说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"妇人怀孕，腹中绞痛，当归芍药散"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当然了，怀孕的时候肚子里面绞痛啊你可以用当归芍药散，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"刚刚怀孕有漏下的时候，我们用胶艾汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这是怀孕的时候肚子绞痛用的方，那你看他的处方，为什么绞痛？原因他写在处方里面。所以他原来的条辨写的很少啊，处方里面大家看，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归、川芎各 3 钱，芍药呢 1 斤，意思就是告诉你重用芍药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。比如说你当归、川芎各3钱，芍药呢用1两，因为你肚子很痛啊，用 1 两。茯苓 5 钱，白术 5 钱，泽泻重一点 6 钱。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归、川芎、芍药 3 味是入血分的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术、茯苓、泽泻呢是入气分是排水的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以这个太太怀孕的时候肚子会疼，是因为有水停在子宫里面，所以才会使用到白术、茯苓。因为里面有白术、茯苓可以利尿，水利掉啊，所以病人吃完就会有点口渴，因为水排掉了，那这是怀孕的时候肚子痛用的方。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170919-a9a2too","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170919-a9a2too","updated":"20240422170919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没有漏下，有滴漏下来的话，这个药不够力的啊，那是胶艾汤症，不能搞错。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170919-qlntgj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170919-qlntgj4","updated":"20240422170919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果说你没有怀孕，老师我没有怀孕，我可不可以吃当归芍药散？当然可以啊！不要脑筋那么笨，说我一定怀孕才吃啊！这个你不用那么那么死脑筋，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹中绞痛，不要说怀孕，女孩子月经痛，可不可以用？当然可以用啊！但是你需要确定她肚子里面的子宫里面有水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果她，她是月经痛，里面是淤血堵在里面的时候，你这个药下去，可以用但还不够力，可能还要再加一些其他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的药，像"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"丹皮、桃仁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊，我们最常用的，经方里最常用就是什么？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茜草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个茜草非常的厉害，我们在攻肿瘤的时候，肝血的时候，肿瘤的时候都在用，因为茜草入肝经啊，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸是补肝的虚，肝没有病，是补肝虚用的。茜草是活血化瘀，肝里面有硬块、肿瘤或者是有淤血在里面的时候用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那子宫肝经络过，所以我们会用茜草下去，妇女的月经痛啊消除的很快。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170919-tjyps8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170919-tjyps8y","updated":"20240422170919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有的人呢，喜欢用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三菱、莪术"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那你用也可以啊，可这两个药它的破血的力量太强，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般来说我们都是打胎的时候用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那小姐跑进来说，我还没有结婚，现在怀孕了，我不要怀孕，对不起，我也不要去医院手术，那你帮我拿掉。小姐你找我麻烦对不对？我是当中医，你居然打胎都找我来打，对不？我的牌子上写的又不是打胎，那怎么办？那小姐说我不要给西医打，就一定要找你。好吧！三菱、莪术活血，可以打掉哦。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那这个堕胎的同时，身体会虚掉，所以我们可以加些当归、生地啊，如果这个小姐比较虚寒一点，瘦弱一点，你不要用生地，用熟地。加川芎，能够活血啊，那你这个时候你不要去加阿胶，这是倒行逆施对不对，你希望她月经来，结果你还再加阿胶是止她的月经，懂不懂我的意思？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你处方要熟，那你再加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"丹皮桃仁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊，那你说老师我这个方剂没有，生药没有，那你有桂枝茯苓丸，也可以落胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170919-4lyk1ks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170919-4lyk1ks","updated":"20240422170919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以这种药呢，你看哦，入妇科的药都是有酒，取方像我们这个当归芍药散是粉剂嘛，那用酒来吞它，那你酒量不好的你用水来吞，也没有关系。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170920-bqu39na","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170920-bqu39na"}},{"ID":"20240422170911-imbdyym","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170911-imbdyym","updated":"20240422170911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人腹中诸疾痛，当归芍药散主之。妇人腹中痛，小建中汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170911-lq24zof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170911-lq24zof","updated":"20240422170911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来呢，大家看，妇人呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹中任何的月经肚子痛，当归芍药散哦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们前面有讲过。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170911-sg419qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170911-sg419qz","updated":"20240422170911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"腹中痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小建中汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这两个一个是实证，一个是虚症哦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。虚劳的时候我们用小建中汤，小建中汤出现的腹中痛，病人一定是没有胃口，东西吃不下，什么都不想吃，你问她说：太太你胃口如何？不好，然后你看她脸色比较淡黄、暗黄、比较苍白，都是小建中汤证，因为它是治疗虚劳用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170927-qqt6tzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170927-qqt6tzb"}},{"ID":"20240422170928-497pm45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170928-497pm45"}}]}